Here's the Java program that analyses the sequence of lights in Morse code format as described:

```java
import java.util.*;
import java.lang.*;

class Solution {
    public List<Integer> parseMorse(String string) {
        List<Integer> resultingList = new ArrayList<>();
        for (int i = 0; i < string.length(); i++) {
            switch (string.charAt(i)) {
                case '-':
                    resultingList.add(3);
                    break;
                case '.':
                    resultingList.add(1);
                    break;
                case ' ':
                    if(i + 1 < string.length() && string.charAt(i + 1) == '/') {
                        i++;
                        if(i + 2 < string.length() && string.charAt(i + 1) == ' ' && string.charAt(i + 2) == ' ') {
                            resultingList.add(7);
                            i += 2;
                        } else {
                            resultingList.add(3);
                            i++;
                        }
                    } else {
                        resultingList.add(1);
                    }
                    break;
                default:
                    break;
            }
        }
        return resultingList;
    }
}
```

