This will give result of the mathematical expression. The `Compute` method can evaluate arithmetic expressions in a string, just like in your case. Remember to validate your input when you are dealing with user-provided expression to avoid any code injection or errors. 

Also be aware that this method follows the order of operations per mathematical rules (PEMDAS/BODMAS) i.e., Parentheses first, then Exponents (ie Powers and Square Roots), then Multiplication and Division, and finally Addition and Subtraction. Considering your example "2+5*3", it is evaluated as "2+(5*3)" = 2+15 = 17.

